:''Not to be confused with [[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Fish Cat]].''
'''Malevolent Island Cat''' is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy that appears in [[Adrift in Fear (Merciless)|The Malevolent Fish]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Malevolent Island Cat
|image = E 666.png
|first appearance = [[Adrift in Fear (Merciless)|The Malevolent Fish]]
|money drop = 520¢ - 2,054¢
}}

==Enemy==
This somewhat tanky enemy deals huge damage at mid-range with its rapid attacks, and its singular knockback makes it difficult to ward off. What makes it worse are its [[Counter-Surge]] and level 1 [[Death Surge]], as they're both guaranteed to hit much further than Malevolent Island Cat itself and wreck further havoc in your ranks. Combine that with any support and they're a true nightmare to behold.

==Strategy==
Alone, this enemy is not a threat. However, since it produces a guaranteed Death Surge, bringing [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune]] meatshields like [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] can help maintain the front line of support.

Because of its Aku trait and lack of immunities, this enemy can be weakened thanks to a variety of crowd control effects. Notable units that match up favorably against it include [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] and [[Summoner Satoru (Uber Rare Cat)|Devil Hunter Satoru]], or Surge-immune attackers such as [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]].

